WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.530
Tell me one thing.
Why are you going to help Mr. Masaru?

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:11.280
It's true that Ashihana can't be trusted.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.290
But we don't have a choice.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.330
That's not what I'm asking.
I'm asking about you.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.540
Why go through so much for Mr. Masaru?

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.050
In every country I've been to,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:28.130
people avoid conflicts
and stick to their own lives.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.290
You wouldn't believe me if I told you.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.370
Let's go.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:15.220
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:20.140
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:24.860
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:29.440
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:33.910
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:39.120
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:43.790
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.630
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.430
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:58.100
All the rest can just burn away

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:03.020
What's right for me is for me alone

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:07.730
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:12.700
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.410
For one single reason

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:24.460
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.380
#3 Abyss

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:36.340
Please.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:44.520
Um, I don't really understand.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:46.940
Of course not.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:53.690
I know it was a bit rough, but we had to
get you away from the bad guys.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:56.780
Bad guys.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:03.120
Right. The bad guys were
probably after your money.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.210
But don't worry.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.250
Um...

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:13.510
I'm Zenji Saiga.
Your father's younger brother.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:19.970
Your father asked me to look after you.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.720
Now, get dressed and eat up.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.980
Narumi... Shirogane...

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.740
I don't know why, but...

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.280
this man is scary!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.620
The Kidnap Team has
a pretty huge mob out there.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:51.340
I heard the place is rigged with traps
everywhere you go.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.550
I've set up a bit of a plan for that.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.340
A certain pair of people will go first.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.800
Boss, a motorcycle!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.010
They're going head first?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.020
This is too reckless even for you!

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.980
Reckless or not,
I'll draw their attention.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.310
You look for Masaru.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.730
Who the hell are you!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.870
-The heck.
-Who is he?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.120
You're going down.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.500
Kill him!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.790
Shut up!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.960
You lapdogs of the filthy rich.
You're all bark and no bite!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.670
Piece! Of! Shit!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.550
Are you crazy? Aren't you afraid of dying?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.390
Be prepared to die, and you shall survive.
Or so they say.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:48.270
It means you might get lucky
if you're determined.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.310
-Shut the hell up.
-Get him!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:54.060
So that's...

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.860
Narumi Kato.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.570
You look for Masaru.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.750
He really is pretty tough.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.500
I might be luckier than I thought.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.460
Let's go, Slaughter Team!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.800
Shit. To the Karakuri Gates!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.680
I won't let you past here, little miss.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:34.900
Ashihana! Leave it to me
and my Rolling Arms!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.860
Good, let's just follow him.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.900
I don't think so.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.700
Dummy.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.330
Damn it.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.840
Come back, Rolling Arms!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.340
Help me, I can't take my gloves off!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.340
-I can't watch this.
-Why?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.050
Their goal is to kill Mr. Masaru.

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.770
No better than the kidnappers.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.980
Just one less foe for us.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.270
What cold unfeeling eyes!

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:24.110
Not even you can get through, Ashihana.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.580
Too bad I can't show you my moves.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.080
Hey.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:36.000
What do you want, little miss?

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.460
A confident mademoiselle.
But I shall pass this gate.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.260
Hey, wait!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.800
I exist only to protect Mr. Masaru.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:47.890
As does Arlequin.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:58.020
Blade of Saint George. Les Arts Martiaux!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.610
-All right, charge!
-Come on!

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.500
You fools, have you forgotten
about my Theo Gautier?

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:24.010
Now then, little stranger girl.
Time for some fun.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.350
I'm finished.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.680
You don't like it?

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:35.430
I'm just not hungry.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.350
I'm sorry.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:43.400
Masaru, you must've already noticed

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:47.360
that there are many people
after your fortune.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:50.160
But you'll be safe here.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.040
I'll personally protect you.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.580
So why don't you let me adopt you?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.420
He's a liar.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.260
He said Narumi and Shirogane
are the bad guys.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:13.220
I've got to get away.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.970
Away from him!

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:17.520
Um, sir?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.940
Can I go to the bathroom?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.310
Sure, it's down the hall.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.740
I'll go with you.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.960
I've got to get away!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:43.040
Takami, that little miss
might surprise you.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.920
She's nothing like us
of the puppeteer clan.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.340
What are you talking about?

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:53.970
We've been trained in puppetry
since we were little. And you...

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:57.140
-Mr. Masaru needs me. Let's begin.
-What?

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.480
Don't get her mad! She has bombs.

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.480
Blow them up, Theo Gautier!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.240
Arlequin!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.790
What happened?

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.670
Why?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.960
The bombs!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.590
You may have trained with puppets
since you were little.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:45.310
But I was born a puppeteer.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:59.620
Masaru. Where are you?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.500
I won't beat you too badly
if you come out now.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:10.130
What do I do now?

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.930
Shirogane... Narumi...

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.010
"PUPPET 14
SADAYOSHI SAIGA"

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.180
Sadayoshi Saiga?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.180
That's my dad's name.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.350
"17 MASARU"

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.900
Why is my name on here?

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.110
What's wrong, big guy?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.450
I need you to tell me something.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.910
Who are you all,
handling these huge puppets?

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.030
Killing people right and left?

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.870
Drop it. We must find Mr. Masaru first.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:46.710
We're teaming up with them for now.
I can't trust them unless I know.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:51.550
Little hottie over there is right
if you ask me.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.220
Woah.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:11:00.430
We puppeteers are known as
the Kuroga clan now.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:06.060
Centuries ago, our clan used to perform
sacred puppet dances for the gods.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.770
Let's leave it at that.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.740
This page is about me.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:18.240
"MASARU IS BAIT"

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.990
What the...

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.040
Masaru is bait.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:28.330
Puppets and puppeteers
have become unnecessary.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.710
Masaru is the "switch" for the Kuroga clan
to blow themselves up.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.720
I'm bait?

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.680
What are you talking about, Dad?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:44.850
So, why are sacred puppet dancers
now doing such shady things?

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:49.690
The Saiga family had made our puppets
since the very beginning.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.900
Back then, Kuroga paid Saiga
to make the puppets.

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:59.200
But now, it is Saiga
that pays us huge amounts of money

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:05.330
to test the performance
of their weapon-like puppets.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.460
Enough. Hurry.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:11.500
We shall meet again if we survive. Go!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.840
Careful, this is a Karakuri mansion.
Traps are everywhere.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.850
Damn, an attack...!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:32.900
Kato.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.240
If I leave my fortune to Masaru,

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.910
the family will hire the Kuroga clan
and fight over Masaru.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:48.830
The divided Kuroga clan will
use their puppets to kill one another.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.750
Masaru is the bait to make that happen.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.420
What does this mean...?

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.170
Found ya.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.760
Damn, not now...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.690
Kato, forget about me.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.560
Let go of me, and go find Mr. Masaru!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.320
Dumbass! Are you a puppet too or what?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:21.110
All of you, dying left and right
without putting up a fight.

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.740
You can't protect Masaru, Shirogane.

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:30.000
How could you understand how precious
life is if you don't care for your own?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.790
Damn it!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.750
I don't want to give my life up!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.760
I don't want to die!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.470
How'd you like that?

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:52.060
Just obey me and be my adopted son.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.850
No...

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.610
I won't become your son.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.940
Never!

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:01.740
You little...!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.120
Yeah, what?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.240
Oh, wonderful.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:14.790
Too bad, but the people
you were waiting for have died.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.300
Liar!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.470
Then let me show you their corpses.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.050
And you will become my son!

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.790
I'm in pain, and my attack...

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.210
And tears are against the rules, damn it.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:59.170
I look like a plain pervert,
panting over a teary-eyed girl.

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.380
Hands off!

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:12.430
Oh yeah, we fell and...

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.480
Kato, you're hurt. Is that...?

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.320
I just slipped.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:25.490
Anyhow, it seems like it's my turn
to tell you to leave now.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.240
It's the ZONAPHA attack.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.410
I can't move anymore.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.500
C-Come on.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.830
Hurry, go...

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:49.850
Is there anything I can do to help?

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.560
Yeah, if you can laugh.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.600
When do I laugh?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.820
Hah, no good.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:02.820
I'm sorry.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:07.400
Just go. I never expected you
to laugh anyways.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.160
Give me one more chance.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.240
You got hurt trying to save me.

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:15.160
I must repay you.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.040
Dang, you're square.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.420
Am I wrong?

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.960
There's no way she'd laugh
at anything I do.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:25.260
Damn it, we've got to save Masaru.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.970
Why am I wasting time like this...

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:34.850
Just go, Shirogane!
I'll show you that I can't make you laugh.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:39.230
Okay, I'll say something funny. Ready?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:40.560
Okay.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.190
Listen, Shirogane.

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:46.400
You're going to be my girl.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:56.200
Ain't funny, eh? So just go.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:01.370
No, it isn't funny.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.220
My attack. It's gone.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:12.340
But now my heart...
No, it's just pounding hard.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:15.260
I'm sorry I can't laugh.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.480
I'm a puppet.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.520
They're both alive!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:28.440
But Narumi's hurt.
All because he tried to save me.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.740
They're both alive?

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.490
Huh, what? Damn it!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.290
I won't give up either!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:45.000
What do you mean, you're a puppet?

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:49.090
Is it because of what I said? Sorry, jeez.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.880
No, don't be.

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.550
I really am a puppet.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:01.850
I grew up in Quiberon in France.
I never knew my parents.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:09.280
In my earliest memory,
I was already being taught puppetry.

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.780
Too rigid. How many times
must I tell you?

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.580
The old women would repeatedly say.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.790
Does that hurt?

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:23.710
You must cast away pain,
along with your name Éléonore.

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:29.550
Sorrow, joy. You must cast away
every human feeling you harbor.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.050
You are a puppet.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.760
You must become
a puppet-handling puppet.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:38.680
Éléonore? Is that your real name?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.600
It is no longer my name.

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.640
I was born a puppeteer.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.400
A puppet with a mission.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.940
That is Shirogane. That is who I am.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.530
A mission? What the heck?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.990
Dirt to dirt. Puppet to puppet.

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:03.080
Somebody made the automata.
Now they must be destroyed by puppets.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.500
Huh?

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:10.880
I have continued to destroy puppets
as I was told, without asking questions.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.180
As a puppet who handles puppets
and doesn't know how to smile.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.890
I can't agree with you there.

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:25.770
Talking of smiles, Masaru's is the best.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:30.770
But Shirogane, your smile
is pretty fine too, you know.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.320
Enough of this chit chat.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.360
A puppet can't smile the way
you just did, okay?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:41.160
Listen here, Shirogane.
You're not a puppet.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.250
I'm not...?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.170
Masaru!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.130
Get down, damn it.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:20:00.550
I've already made up my mind.
I won't let you boss me around.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.760
What are you talking about?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.770
I'm scared. I can't!

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:09.310
Come back, Masaru.
I won't beat you anymore.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.190
I was lonely all this time.

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:17.990
But those two cheered me up.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.030
They came to save me today, too.

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.330
He even got hurt.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.160
Don't give up!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.210
You'll become strong.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.210
Stronger than me.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:33.290
I'll be strong. I'll be strong!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.050
I can!

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:39.260
Come down now. You're going to be my son.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.010
I can't be the way I was.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.850
I'd only cause them more trouble.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.810
I have to change.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:48.520
Get down this instant!

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.900
No, don't be stupid. You'll die!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:21:00.820
I'm letting go of the crybaby
I used to be.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:04.870
And if I survive...

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:08.710
If I survive, I'm going to laugh
all the time.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.710
That's who I'll be!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.920
I won't let you go that easily,
Mr. Ashihana.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.090
Time to tie you up.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.190
Masaru Saiga?

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:38.440
Or is it?

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:43.700
You're the guy
who tried to kill me, right?

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.410
Uh, yeah. That's me.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.950
I have a proposition.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:52.210
I want to hire you.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.710
Switch to my side.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:03.180
He's like a whole different person.

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:04.760
Those eyes.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:10.230
They're a beast's eyes, thirsty for life.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.190
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.280
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:23.860
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:28.580
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:35.080
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:40.260
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:44.630
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:49.970
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:53.640
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:58.060
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:03.190
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:09.370
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.700
become free

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.250
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:16.540
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:21.130
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:25.930
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:32.470
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
